  "Cleric uses graduated autonomy by problem type: per-problem-class accuracy scores decide where the agent acts independently and where it escalates to an engineer with a recommendation and evidence.": 1,
  "Cleric verifies outcomes in a closed loop by triangulating after the fact: whether the alert recurred, whether downstream services stabilized, and whether the engineer overrode the fix.": 1,
  "Per Cleric's own report, Traversal verification is open-loop (no automated check that the inferred causal chain matched the true root cause), Resolve is designed for autonomous remediation against pre-defined workflows, and Traversal does investigation only with no remediation.": 1
